Z||000000||Ozzy||05-15-2000||12:23 AM||||What other cars/trucks had the same heads as our beloved Fiero? I want to look around for another exhaust manifold that will bolt up. <P>I know this has been discussed before but did anyone actually find an alternative manifold? <P>Ozzy||||reg||5
