Z||000004||Fiasco||05-15-2000||12:57 AM||||-Those might not have the same exact manifolds, though- <BR>I'm not sure... do they?||||reg||5
Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||05-15-2000||02:03 AM||||Parents used to have a chevy blazer with the 2.8, and I have 2 friends with the 2.8 in their cars.. an 88 beretta and an 88 oldsmobile cutlass supreme.<P>some cavaliers and firebirds also had/have the 2.8..||||reg||1
Z||000006||Monkeyman||05-15-2000||09:43 AM||||Just because it says "2.8" doesn't mean it's the HO version in the Fiero.  I was lead to believe the Fiero was the only one to get the HO version, although it seems to me that there was one more...||||reg||1
Z||000007||Flash Box||05-15-2000||10:51 AM||||My Camaro has the 2.8 in it and some Firebirds do as well. If you go to <A HREF="http://www.thirdgen.org" TARGET=_blank>www.thirdgen.org</A>  they have a V6 board and some of those guys use to own Fieros maybe they could tell you more. Just a suggestion. ||||reg||1
